<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Fluor said on recommend list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Fluor said on recommend list.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Fluor Corp was added to Dean Witter's recommend list, according to a Dean Witter source on Friday.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 1-1/2 to 65-7/8.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
